[{"title":"置酒西楼呈主公龙图","author":"郭祥正","text":"新楼与客一凭栏，眼界方惊阿堵宽。\n峡石倚天开玉垒，清淮浮日洗金丸。\n少陵才力吟非易，摩诘工夫画亦难。\n向晚西风吹坐急，欲凭鸿鹄借修翰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48266,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"置酒思禹亭呈主公龙图","author":"郭祥正","text":"小亭危瞰二峰尖，禹迹千年气象炎。\n浪溅日华金沸鼎，云收山色镜开奁。\n持杯选胜吟谁敌，与客忘形德愈谦。\n浅量为公甘醉倒，扶头准拟病厌厌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48267,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别行中龙图","author":"郭祥正","text":"要登画戟发江南，千里春泥倦亦甘。\n力探禹工观骇浪，却寻佛迹宴圜庵。\n欲陈旧学羞茅塞，喜听新诗纵酒酣。\n归去忆公劳梦想，冷猿幽鸟语相参。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48268,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送庐倅赵习之朝奉还台","author":"郭祥正","text":"洛阳名誉弟兄兼，雾拂青天幸一瞻。\n善政及瓜民惜去，美材如玉士称淹。\n风摇湖浪应须避，马溅春泥不用嫌。\n闻说朝廷图旧德，姓名交奏动宸严。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48269,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻宣州王左丞被召还阙拟送","author":"郭祥正","text":"熙宁治迹俨如新，圣主今朝用旧臣。\n松冒秋霜方见节，玉经炉炭始知真。\n具瞻尽喜周公入，论道谁先孟子醇。\n试作云霖苏旱暵，西疆犹有未来人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48270,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王左丞移镇金陵","author":"郭祥正","text":"千艘飞橹入淮湾，竹马争迎旧帅还。\n牛酒未颁诸邑下，旌旗先谒两山间。\n武侯暂拥元戎节，裴度须归上宰班。\n精义入神遗像在，载瞻堂庑泪重潸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48271,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题史君梁正叔浩然堂","author":"郭祥正","text":"养浩深思孟氏醇，一堂窗户更清新。\n篆香未过日停午，蚁酒初浮莺弄春。\n枉尺直寻非我欲，仁民爱物任吾真。\n三年课绩书优最，此地谁来继后尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48272,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和孔周翰侍郎洪州绝句十首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"谁知北客与春期，乍见山桃一两枝。\n却忆洛阳行乐处，卖花天气晚晴时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48273,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和孔周翰侍郎洪州绝句十首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"渔船归尽晚江空，只有杨花罥细风。\n多少春愁与春恨，为君都付酒杯中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48274,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和孔周翰侍郎洪州绝句十首 其三","author":"郭祥正","text":"楼居且欲趁虚凉，九月江风未变霜。\n强把一樽开醉眼，长安不见又残阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48275,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和孔周翰侍郎洪州绝句十首 其四","author":"郭祥正","text":"寸心无事自然灰，不是南柯一梦回。\n水畔小楼无客到，独携筇杖等閒来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48276,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和孔周翰侍郎洪州绝句十首 其五","author":"郭祥正","text":"行行杨柳古墙阴，摆尽春风绿转深。\n俯仰自能无一事，何须投迹向山林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48277,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和孔周翰侍郎洪州绝句十首 其六","author":"郭祥正","text":"江云凝雨疾风过，阵马争回万叠波。\n平地看时真一笑，鹏腾鳌倒欲如何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48278,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和孔周翰侍郎洪州绝句十首 其七","author":"郭祥正","text":"为问荷华能白红，东湖遥想鉴湖同。\n金龟换酒要佳客，归棹须乘月下风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48279,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和孔周翰侍郎洪州绝句十首 其八","author":"郭祥正","text":"不到天门未肯回，重山复岭一时开。\n仙风桂露争飘洒，襟袖都无世俗埃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48280,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和孔周翰侍郎洪州绝句十首 其九","author":"郭祥正","text":"可怜一雨洗焦枯，卷尽浮云日上初。\n独倚高楼聊写望，骨清神爽欲凌虚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48281,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和孔周翰侍郎洪州绝句十首 其十","author":"郭祥正","text":"东湖入望晚波平，蒲叶圆荷各自青。\n不用更寻徐孺宅，编茅支竹一碑亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48282,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金陵","author":"郭祥正","text":"洗尽青春初变晴，晓光微散淡烟横。\n谢家池上无多景，只有黄鹂一两声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48283,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔者","author":"郭祥正","text":"从来生计托鱼虾，卖得青钱付酒家。\n一醉不知波浪险，却垂长钓入芦花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48284,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"琅琊道中","author":"郭祥正","text":"山头腊雪未全消，山下春泉响石桥。\n方丈不知深几许，马行时有冷香飘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48285,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀文忠公","author":"郭祥正","text":"平生最爱醉翁诗，游遍琅琊想醉时。\n一代风流随手尽，谷泉岩鸟不胜悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48286,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"日公绿萝庵","author":"郭祥正","text":"一庵春静绿萝舒，拂拂香风宴坐馀。\n只恐乘云沧海去，未应池水老鲸鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48287,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"示秦医二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"忧来何物可销除，幸与秦医校局图。\n白黑势成分胜负，不知柯烂得归无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48288,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"示秦医二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"门临池水静无风，绿树阴阴小径通。\n时有秦生来过我，一枰成败漫论功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48289,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和松长老龙井","author":"郭祥正","text":"龙蟠井底待风雷，谁谓无功洗旱埃。\n昨夜山前行雨足，收藏头角复归来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48290,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再至汀州倅宅南楼二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"一岁登楼只欲归，得归人事信难知。\n重来跨马三千里，楼上春风为我悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48291,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再至汀州倅宅南楼二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"楼外青山似故人，雨馀山色静无尘。\n青山依旧人还老，一片离愁挂晚春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48292,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻笛","author":"郭祥正","text":"何处佳人玉笛吹，春风已过落梅时。\n行云不动残阳下，欢乐悲愁各自知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48293,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再登南楼怀元舆三首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"欲上层楼足力微，世情尘事老方知。\n离骚一曲何人会，空使潇湘鬼物悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48294,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再登南楼怀元舆三首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"忧患欣逢贤故人，南楼解榻振衣尘。\n赤壶频送兵厨酒，满酌能回老病春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48295,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再登南楼怀元舆三首 其三","author":"郭祥正","text":"朽株难倚暖风吹，一日萌芽亦有时。\n试上高楼南北望，无私春力少人知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48296,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书陶弘景传后","author":"郭祥正","text":"能辞朝市隐山中，爱种青松听好风。\n不学许由长洗耳，谬为图谶悦萧公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48297,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元舆十绝 睡起","author":"郭祥正","text":"睡觉纱厨酒尚醺，老来诗句怯题春。\n冥搜一夜添华发，不认青铜鉴里人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48298,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元舆十绝 种竹二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"旋斸墙根数十寻，琅玕移种碧林林。\n何须待得鸾凰食，且欲炎天布好阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48299,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元舆十绝 种竹二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"龙角犀尖一夜长，为怜刚节不须香。\n他时截作鲸鳌钓，岂止浓阴覆女墙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48300,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元舆十绝 春归四首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"九十日春今日归，丁宁莺蝶莫相疑。\n明年信到梅梢早，不似人心有改时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48301,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元舆十绝 春归四首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"断送春归海水边，淡烟轻吹半晴天。\n东皇若问人间事，为报君王寿万年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48302,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元舆十绝 春归四首 其三","author":"郭祥正","text":"青春归去岂无情，分付朱明事已成。\n为向残年问消息，再吹阳律到枯茎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48303,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元舆十绝 春归四首 其四","author":"郭祥正","text":"谁道青春去未回，我疑长在黄金杯。\n只嫌花片随流水，荡漾无情唤不来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48304,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元舆十绝 答省师诗卷","author":"郭祥正","text":"手携诗卷屡相过，要把青铜垢尽磨。\n言说从来无实义，更寻佳句欲如何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48305,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元舆十绝 休师携茶相过二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"世情弹指旋成尘，物外论交只与君。\n试拣松阴投石坐，一杯分我建溪云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48306,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元舆十绝 休师携茶相过二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"晚风吹坐忽生凉，旋碾新茶与客尝。\n我本无心无所證，沉烟何事结圆光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48307,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄李伯华法曹","author":"郭祥正","text":"同异从来势所分，感君怜我屡过门。\n西风扫尽林间瘴，更欲相要倒一樽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48308,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食紫莼赤鲟示王博士二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"辞家倏忽已残年，身世今为海上仙。\n饱食紫莼香味美，不知归路隔三千。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48309,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食紫莼赤鲟示王博士二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"西湖寄榻绝逢迎，唯只云山似有情。\n底事却忘迁谪恨，江南无此赤鲟羹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48310,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和休师见怀二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"幽栖新卜野僧邻，憔悴谁怜旧史君。\n幸有松声吹骤雨，可须歌响遏行云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48311,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和休师见怀二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"细路沿崖过女墙，压枝黄橘旋分尝。\n林间可乐无如此，更问嫦娥借月光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48312,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李伯华见过小饮二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"伴我林间倒一樽，西湖紫翠变黄昏。\n鸟迁深树鱼依藻，客散樽空亦闭门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48313,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李伯华见过小饮二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"感君飞盖过云林，浊酒沽来取次斟。\n冠帻攲斜倾醉耳，水声松响洗尘心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48314,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈老父携茶见访因留小饮二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"有儿不娶似庞公，香火传家悟性空。\n父子相扶俱白发，人间能有几人同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48315,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈老父携茶见访因留小饮二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"怜我非辜挂网罗，手携筇杖数相过。\n一杯得伴仙翁醉，谗喙虽长奈我何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48316,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中寄休师三首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"南漳佛子素多闻，颖秀从来更出群。\n无量宝台师化坐，一盂香饭我求分。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48317,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中寄休师三首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"元无一物不须空，寄语文殊任过从。\n辗转形骸聊示疾，坐分高广颇相容。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48318,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中寄休师三首 其三","author":"郭祥正","text":"僧窗寄榻断来车，一饭供盘只野蔬。\n疠鬼见侵宁有智，我今皮骨已无馀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48319,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"所居","author":"郭祥正","text":"营居未就借僧居，贝篆翻寻颇食蔬。\n独步青苔人散后，旋收红柿鸟分馀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48320,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"休师惠雪笋","author":"郭祥正","text":"雪竹生芽玉一簪，北人此味岂尝谙。\n病中得食胜牛乳，行矣阿难师勿惭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48321,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢阮几圣惠大蟹","author":"郭祥正","text":"感君风谊我何堪，问遗时时过草庵。\n今岁未知霜蟹美，一餐还似到江南。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48322,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"津梁方丈","author":"郭祥正","text":"转山楼阁路相通，屡得分经丈室中。\n六入循元无重浊，三缘故断出樊笼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48323,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月下怀广胜华师","author":"郭祥正","text":"下方遥忆上方僧，素月青林隔几层。\n钟磬声沉香篆熄，只应诗思冷如冰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48324,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题华师院壁","author":"郭祥正","text":"邂逅营居得近僧，唯师更住最高层。\n半瓯香茗浮春雪，一饭寒蔬带晓冰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48325,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"全师惠诗","author":"郭祥正","text":"十里湖山紫翠秋，师居独占一岩幽。\n谈经已许分吾坐，更有新诗索献酬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48326,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"百岁王姥自云平生未尝服药","author":"郭祥正","text":"不服丹砂不养真，老来天与健精神。\n自怜五十头垂雪，始见人间百岁人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48327,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酒海吾饮器也","author":"郭祥正","text":"红浪滔天玉海春，方壶有路可藏真。\n长鲸一吸桑田变，知是人间几岁人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48328,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄陈显仁秀才二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"君家大阮最能诗，又见麟孙出盛时。\n笔力纵横驱阵马，成才不患少人知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48329,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄陈显仁秀才二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"自怜破甑已无堪，况复经年卧瘴岩。\n忽得新诗慰牢落，却疑仙露洒尘衫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48330,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"君仪惠玳瑁冠犀簪并分泉守茶六饼二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"玳瑁裁冠犀作簪，正宜萧散野人心。\n从今顶戴抛乌帽，一任秋霜两鬓侵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48331,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"君仪惠玳瑁冠犀簪并分泉守茶六饼二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"分送泉州太守茶，团团紫饼社前芽。\n从今不复忧烦渴，时取甘泉煮雪华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48332,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄王丞相荆公","author":"郭祥正","text":"谢公投老宅钟山，门外江潮去复还。\n欲买扁舟都载月，一身和影伴公閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48333,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和上荆公","author":"郭祥正","text":"沟水回环莲子多，小桥时有野禽过。\n移船更近东陂去，冉冉黄尘奈我何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48334,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"原武按堤 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"堤防兴作几时休，自笑羸骖不少留。\n身与春风来郑国，心随汴水到扬州。\n无功便合归耕去，有命宁烦枉道求。\n白日西沉更回首，问人何处是重楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48335,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"原武按堤 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"原武城西看杏花，纷纷红雪委黄沙。\n何如姑熟溪头见，照水蒙烟小谢家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48336,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"原武按堤 其三","author":"郭祥正","text":"黄尘蔽日晚风高，两目昏花客思劳。\n却忆江南渔父乐，河鲀入网采蒌蒿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48337,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"原武按堤 其四","author":"郭祥正","text":"圣贤君相继虞唐，问罪戎夷复故疆。\n不得一军提将印，漫来淤地阅堤防。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48338,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"原武按堤 其五","author":"郭祥正","text":"白驹驰隙鬓毛斑，簿领纷纷世愈难。\n安得一军提将印，横行西域斩楼兰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48339,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"原武按堤 其六","author":"郭祥正","text":"云溶溶，风习习，桃花露点胭脂湿。\n青春归尽人未归，原武冈头时独立。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48340,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]